OUP is a reserved word in SQL. It groups either/or prerequisites: any one course in a group is enough." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="950" y="560" width="330" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>